        reversal twin of RtrRsn / AddtlRtrRsnInf / RtrOrgtr. A reader that knows
        only Rsn / AddtlInf / Orgtr returns all three reason columns NULL here.
     2. The message container is named after the message itself
        (<pacs.007.001.01>) rather than <FIToFIPmtRvsl>.
     Shape from testdata/pacs004_partial_return.xml, with the return names
     replaced by reversal names. -->
